#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""One-off: writes code/analysis/weakness_register_source.csv, the hand-written source of the weakness register.

After this first write, edit the CSV directly (it is the source of truth); this script is kept only as a record of how the first version was produced and is not part of regenerate_all.sh.
Cells may contain {tokens} (for example {full_text_undecided}); build_weakness_register.py replaces them with the computed figures so the numbers cannot go stale.
"""
